{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0102-s003", "text": "Det högsta vitsordet är 10 och det lägsta 4.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0102-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.269622802734375, "generation_seconds": 9.115928191924468, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0102-s004", "text": "Den studerande har rätt att försöka höja sina vitsord genom att göra om prov eller uppgifter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0102-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.28363037109375, "generation_seconds": 14.271907494869083, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0102-s005", "text": "När den studerande har avlagt gymnasiets hela lärokurs får hen ett avgångsbetyg från gymnasiet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0102-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.311492919921875, "generation_seconds": 14.758511309046298, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0103-s001", "text": "Under gymnasiet avlägger de studerande studentexamen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0103-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.252838134765625, "generation_seconds": 9.76056950702332, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0103-s002", "text": "Studentexamen är densamma i hela Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0103-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.28814697265625, "generation_seconds": 7.4843679999466985, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0103-s003", "text": "I den ingår prov i modersmål och litteratur, det andra inhemska språket, främmande språk, matematik och naturvetenskapliga och humanistisk-samhälleliga läroämnen, det vill säga realämnen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0103-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.882448979591837, "peak": 0.381103515625, "generation_seconds": 26.333663942059502, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0103-s004", "text": "Realämnen är till exempel historia, fysik, biologi, psykologi, religion, filosofi, geografi och hälsokunskap.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0103-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.3057861328125, "generation_seconds": 16.48668164690025, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0103-s005", "text": "Istället för provet i modersmål kan den studerande också avlägga ett prov i läroämnet finska eller svenska som andraspråk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-gymnasium/narration/resume-20261103T014826968702+0000-3/hb-c08-u0103-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.30645751953125, "generation_seconds": 14.809262837981805, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
